代码：https://github.com/DeepGraphLearning/GraphAny/blob/main/README.md
论文：https://openreview.net/pdf?id=1Qpt43cqhg
"Fully-Inductive Node Classification on Arbitrary Graphs"
"Fully-Inductive Learning","Cross-Graph Generalization","Graph Foundation Models"
GraphAny 不是 Domain Adaptation（UDA/SFDA）方法，而是 Fully-Inductive Graph Foundation Model 方法，目标是跨任意图（Cross-Graph Generalization）的泛化，而不是跨域适应（Domain Adaptation）

This repository is based on PyTorch 2.1, Pytorch-Lightning 2.2, PyG 2.4, DGL 2.1, and Hydra 1.3.
创建新环境：conda create -n graphany python=3.10
安装pytorch：pip install torch==2.1.1 torchvision==0.16.1 torchaudio==2.1.1 --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu118
安装hydra：pip install hydra-core==1.3.2
安装pyg：pip install pyg_lib torch_scatter torch_sparse -f https://data.pyg.org/whl/torch-2.1.0+cu118.html
然后：pip install torch_geometric
推荐dgl：pip install dgl==1.1.3





